# Prints the builder's command list on entering the checkout (direnv).
cat <<'END'
builder: the Erisia pack builder (README.md has more)
  nix flake check                 tests, lints and the golden file list
  nix build .#e36-server          build the E36 server
  nix build .#ServerPack          build what players download
  nix build .#golden-e36 && cp result tests/golden/e36.tree
                                  accept an intended change to the outputs
  nix run .#pack-docs             read the pack options documentation
  ./pull.sh / ./push.sh           fetch and rebase / publish as master
END
